        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">All Vehicles</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">Cars, Trucks, SUVs & Vans</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#A61E22]">Mobile</p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm mt-1">We Come to Your Location</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-white py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
        <div>
          <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Delaware's Car Lockout Specialists</p>
          <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6 leading-snug">
            Professional Car Lockout Service Throughout Delaware
          </h2>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Getting locked out of your car is one of the most stressful, inconvenient things that can happen — especially if you're running late, it's dark outside, or you're in an unfamiliar area. It happens to everyone at some point. You step out for just a second, the door closes, and you're standing there with no way back in. When that happens anywhere in Delaware, 1st Capital Locksmith is the call to make.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Our mobile locksmiths use professional, non-destructive entry tools to open your car door quickly and safely — without breaking a window, scratching your paint, or damaging your door frame. We work on all vehicle makes and models including sedans, trucks, SUVs, minivans, and commercial vehicles.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
            We proudly serve drivers throughout <a href="/service-areas/dover-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Dover</a>, <a href="/service-areas/milford-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Milford</a>, <a href="/service-areas/smyrna-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Smyrna</a>, <a href="/service-areas/camden-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Camden</a>, <a href="/service-areas/harrington-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Harrington</a>, <a href="/service-areas/frederica-de/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">Frederica</a>, and all surrounding communities in Kent County, Delaware. Wherever you're stranded, we will get to you as fast as possible and have you back on the road quickly.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
          <!-- PHOTO SLOT 1: Recommended 800×500px — locksmith opening a car door on-site -->
          <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
            <img
              src="/images/car-lockout.jpg"
              alt="1st Capital Locksmith technician unlocking a car door in Delaware"
              class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
              width="800"
              height="500"
            />
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#F8F8F5] rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200">
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-6">Car Lockout Situations We Handle:</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {[
                "Keys Locked Inside the Car",
                "Keys Locked in the Trunk",
                "Broken Key in Door Lock",
                "Jammed or Frozen Door Lock",
                "Late-Night & After-Hours Lockouts",
                "Parking Lot & Roadside Lockouts",
                "Commercial & Fleet Vehicle Lockouts",
                "All Makes, Models & Vehicle Types",
              ].map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-center gap-3 text-gray-700">
                  <span class="w-6 h-6 bg-[#A61E22] rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-3 h-3 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" />
                    </svg>
                  </span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
            <div class="mt-6 pt-6 border-t border-gray-200">
              <a
                href="tel:3027350050"
                class="w-full inline-flex justify-center items-center rounded-full bg-[#A61E22] px-6 py-3 text-white font-bold hover:bg-[#8C181B] transition"
              >
                Call (302) 735-0050 Now
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Services Detail -->
  <section id="services" class="bg-[#F8F8F5] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">What We Handle</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">
          Car Lockout Situations We Respond To in Delaware
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-700 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          No two lockouts are exactly the same. Here is a detailed look at every type of car lockout situation we handle and how we approach each one professionally and safely.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Keys Locked Inside the Car in Delaware</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            The classic lockout — you step out for just a moment, the door swings shut, and your keys are sitting right there on the seat or in the cupholder. Our mobile locksmiths use professional long-reach tools and air wedge entry systems to unlock your vehicle door without causing any damage.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We work on virtually every vehicle make and model — domestic cars, foreign vehicles, trucks, SUVs, minivans, and crossovers. Modern vehicles with electronic locks are no problem; we have the right tools regardless of lock type.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Call 1st Capital Locksmith at (302) 735-0050. We will dispatch immediately and get you back inside your vehicle as quickly as possible — no damage, no drama.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0zM19 17a2 2 0 11-4 0 2 2 0 014 0z" />
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16V6a1 1 0 00-1-1H4a1 1 0 00-1 1v10l2 2h7l1-2zM13 6h3l3 4v4h-2" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Keys Locked in the Trunk in Delaware</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Locking your keys in the trunk is surprisingly easy to do when loading or unloading groceries, luggage, or sports equipment. Depending on your vehicle, accessing the trunk from inside may not be possible if the car itself is locked.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Our locksmiths gain non-destructive access through the vehicle door first and then release the trunk, or access the trunk directly depending on the vehicle's design — clean and safe, without damaging the door frame or trunk lock mechanism.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Don't risk damaging your vehicle. Call 1st Capital Locksmith and we'll be at your location throughout Delaware to sort it out the right way.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15 17h5l-1.405-1.405A2.032 2.032 0 0118 14.158V11a6 6 0 10-12 0v3.159c0 .538-.214 1.055-.595 1.436L4 17h5m6 0v1a3 3 0 11-6 0v-1m6 0H9" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Emergency Car Lockout Response in Delaware</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Some car lockouts are more urgent than others — stranded somewhere unfamiliar, late at night, in severe weather, or with a child or pet inside the vehicle. 1st Capital Locksmith prioritizes urgent lockout calls and dispatches immediately throughout Delaware.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            If a child or pet is locked inside a vehicle in warm weather, call 911 immediately — this is a life-safety emergency. Once the safety concern is resolved, we can assist with vehicle access.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            For all urgent lockout situations — late-night, stranded motorists, unsafe locations — call 1st Capital Locksmith at (302) 735-0050. We move fast and we come to you.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Jammed, Frozen, or Damaged Car Door Locks</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            Not every lockout is caused by keys being left inside. Sometimes the lock itself is the problem — a jammed door lock that won't turn, a frozen cylinder in cold weather, or a lock damaged by forced entry. These require a different approach but are within what our locksmiths handle every day.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            For frozen locks, we carry de-icing solutions and appropriate tools. For jammed or mechanically failed locks, we assess the cause and use the most appropriate entry method. If the lock needs repair or replacement, we can handle that on-site.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Never force a key into a jammed lock — the risk of snapping it inside the cylinder turns a simple lockout into a more expensive <a href="/services/broken-key-extraction/" class="text-[#A61E22] hover:underline font-medium">broken key extraction</a>. Call us first.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 border border-gray-200 hover:shadow-lg transition">
          <div class="w-14 h-14 bg-[#A61E22]/10 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6">
            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-7 h-7 text-[#A61E22]" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v14M3 21h18M9 21v-4a1 1 0 011-1h4a1 1 0 011 1v4" />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22] mb-4">Commercial & Fleet Vehicle Lockout Service</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            A lockout involving a work vehicle, delivery truck, or fleet van doesn't just inconvenience one person — it can bring a job site to a halt, delay deliveries, and cost your business real money. We understand the urgency and respond quickly to get drivers back on the road.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
            We work on commercial vans, work trucks, box trucks, and passenger vehicles used for business purposes. Single vehicle lockout at a job site or an ongoing fleet service arrangement — we're equipped to help.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
            Fleet managers throughout Kent County — call us at (302) 735-0050 and we will dispatch immediately. No job is too large or too small.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Photo Gallery Strip -->
  <section class="bg-white py-16">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">On-Site Car Lockout Service</p>
        <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-[#1A1F22]">Fast, Professional, Non-Destructive — Anywhere in Delaware</h2>
      </div>
      <!-- PHOTO SLOT 4, 5, 6: Recommended 600×400px each
           Photo 4 — close-up of professional lockout tools
           Photo 5 — locksmith at work at a car door
           Photo 6 — relieved customer back inside their vehicle -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
          <img
            src="/images/lockout-tools.jpg"
            alt="Professional car lockout tools used by 1st Capital Locksmith"
            class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
            width="600"
            height="400"
          />
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#F8F8F5]">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1F22] text-sm">Professional Entry Tools</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">Non-destructive — no damage to your vehicle</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
          <img
            src="/images/car-lockout-technician.jpg"
            alt="1st Capital Locksmith technician unlocking a vehicle in Delaware"
            class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
            width="600"
            height="400"
          />
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#F8F8F5]">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1F22] text-sm">Fast, Skilled Technicians</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">Trained on all makes, models & lock types</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 shadow-sm">
          <img
            src="/images/car-lockout-delaware.jpg"
            alt="Customer back inside their vehicle after car lockout service in Delaware"
            class="w-full h-64 object-cover"
            width="600"
            height="400"
          />
          <div class="p-4 bg-[#F8F8F5]">
            <p class="font-semibold text-[#1A1F22] text-sm">Back on the Road Quickly</p>
            <p class="text-gray-500 text-xs mt-1">We come to you — home, work, or anywhere in Delaware</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Why Choose Us -->
  <section class="bg-[#1A1F22] py-20">
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6">
      <div class="text-center mb-14">
        <p class="text-[#9A9D62] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wide text-sm mb-3">Why Choose Us</p>
        <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-white mb-4">
          Why Delaware Drivers Call 1st Capital Locksmith for Car Lockouts
        </h2>
        <p class="text-gray-400 max-w-3xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          When you're locked out of your car, you need someone who responds fast, treats your vehicle with care, and charges a fair price. Here is why drivers throughout Delaware choose us.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        {[
          {
            title: "Fast Dispatch Throughout Delaware",
            body: "We answer the phone and dispatch immediately. Our mobile locksmiths are stationed throughout the area so we can respond quickly to car lockout calls across Kent County and beyond.",
          },
          {
            title: "Non-Destructive Entry",
            body: "We use professional-grade long-reach tools and air wedge systems to open your vehicle without breaking windows or damaging your door, weather stripping, or lock mechanism. Your car will look exactly as it did before we arrived.",
          },
          {
            title: "All Makes & Models",
            body: "Cars, trucks, SUVs, minivans, commercial vans — we handle them all. Domestic or foreign, old or brand new, our locksmiths have experience with virtually every vehicle on the road today.",
          },
